  {
   "key": "scene_03",
   "text": "Three people carry this story. First, Rayan Cherki, in the middle of France's attacking three. Our reading: against five defenders, France need someone to find the gaps, and that is his job. Second, Arda Güler, in Turkiye's midfield four. If Turkiye are to threaten France at all, the ball probably has to pass through him. Remember his name. Third, Kylian Mbappé. Eurosport France noted that he missed the Italy match with a hamstring problem. Before this one Zidane said, in translation: there is no problem, he will be with us.",
