   "key": "scene_04",
   "text": "Minute 1. Turkiye line up in a 5-4-1, and France take the ball. FotMob's momentum graph has France on top in 79 percent of the first-half minutes. The chances come, and they do not go in. Minute 21: Barcola, on a fast break, is saved. Minute 34: Mbappé is saved. Minute 35: Turkiye's best first-half chance, from İsmail Yüksek, is saved too. Half-time. 0-0. France have the ball, Turkiye have a plan, and the plan is holding.",
