   "text": "Neither coach's post-match words are in the match data we have, so the press gives the verdict. Ouest-France writes, in translation: \"This wastefulness made Les Bleus tremble until the end of the match, and the clinching goal came from Kroupi, his first, well set up by Cherki.\" The match data gives that word a number. France had 7 big chances, and missed 6. Our verdict, in one sentence: France deserved the win, and earned the worry.",
