  {
   "key": "scene_09",
   "text": "France qualified for the quarter-finals and finished first in the group, franceinfo and Ouest-France report. For Turkiye, 5 defeats became 6. But AFP writes, in translation, that the content of the match \"once again left a lot to be desired\". That is the open question for Zidane's side. The control is there. The finishing, on this night, was not. The lesson: control earns you chances, and only finishing earns you comfort. If you like match stories built on the numbers, subscribe. And tell us in the comments: a finishing problem, or one unlucky night?",
