  {
   "key": "short_1",
   "text": "An 8.4 rating, the best on the pitch. Rayan Cherki played centrally, behind Kylian Mbappé, in France's 4-2-3-1. In the 80th minute his pass set up Junior Kroupi for 2-0, Kroupi's first international goal. France had 60 percent of the ball and 23 shots. Cherki took one, worth 0.04 expected goals. The data lists one assist and one shot. It cannot show the rest of his work. Should Cherki start behind Mbappé every match? Full story on the channel.",
